WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.688
Sadie: Sometimes I just feel like nothing I do matters. Like I'm not special.

00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:10.678
We only got one retweet today. From your mom. Sad.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.300
We were just wondering if maybe you could give our blog a shout out?

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.639
Toby: A shout out from me would be a little off-brand.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.140
I have 15,000 followers.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.140
You know what that means, with a community like this?

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.600
McKayla: More to the left, his heart's more to the left.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.900
You're just hitting bone, dude!

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.000
Sadie: I'm trying!

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
["Always Forever" by Cults plays]

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.600
[McKayla?:] Rosedale High is trending!

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.779
McKayla: I really hope nothing bad happened to him.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.040
Sadie: It's like, poof! He vanished, right?

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.500
McKayla: Anybody could be next. Even you.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.700
Sadie: You can find more information on our Tragedy Girls Twitter page.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:52.350
McKayla: Your brains, my charisma... We could do anything.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.100
Reporter: Quick sound bite from the Tragedy Girls.
McKayla: OMG.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.360
Sadie: Can you [unintelligible]

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.400
Reporter: Are you afraid that the killer will target you because of your infamous blog?

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.089
McKayla: We will not take any more shit from this serial killer.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.140
I'm so scared right now.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:08.700
We look amazing.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.600
[?:] Jeez. McKayla?

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.300
McKayla: Shit!

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:15.200
Sadie: Dammit, McKay!

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:16.700
McKayla: I'm sorry!

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:17.800
Sadie: Stay in character.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:20.620
Teacher: Phones off!

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.000
Sadie: But it's a matter of life and death.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.400
Big Al: You bitches are crazy!

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.200
[McKayla, Sadie and Lowell laugh hysterically]

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:30.400
McKayla: We used to be the same, you and me.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.060
Do you remember our first time?

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.600
Reporter: I just want to know, what's next for the Tragedy Girls?

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:46.340
[Janitor obliviously whistles]

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.200
Jordan: What happened there?

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:56.800
McKayla: Nothing.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.251
Jordan: Is that blood?

00:01:58.251 --> 00:01:59.600
McKayla: Heavy flow day.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.800
Jordan: I don't know if- that's not how that works, right?

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:18.800
[Subtitles end here]

